# Play test of Tide Farm (CIPlay tide_farm, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Tide Farm
expect step 0
expect title The Last Harvest

# From the islet's beach along the planks onto the farm: the notebook on the table
walk 8 0.4 to 13 0.4 to 18 0.4 h=1.1
zone farm
expect step 1
read Farmer's notebook
expect step 2

# The glasshouse is locked, the wheel jammed
walk 21 -0.2 to 22.4 -0.2 to 24.5 -0.2 blocked
use wheel
expect message wedged tight

# The tool shed on the islet: the crowbar, the net gun
walk 18 0.4 to 13 0.4 to 6 0.4 to -2.6 3 h=3.5
open Tool chest
expect story crowbar 1
expect item NetGun 1
expect step 3

# Two of the runaway chickens
catch Chicken 2
expect step 4

# The wheel freed: it turns around its axle, the glasshouse doors slide open, the harvest
use wheel
expect message wheel creaks
expect story crowbar 0
expect hidden wheel
expect shown wheelturning
expect spinsown wheelturning
wait 2
walk 21 -0.2 to 22.4 -0.2 to 25 -0.2 h=1.1
open Glasshouse harvest
expect item Placeable_Sprinkler 1
expect done
